<title>JAPAN: Kanematsu, Unidux to announce tie-up at 0700 GMT.</title>
<headline>Kanematsu, Unidux to announce tie-up at 0700 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kanematsu Corp and Unidux Inc said on Wednesday that they will hold a news conference at 4 p.m. (0700 GMT) on the issue of an equity and business tie-up.</p>
</text>
